{"ID":"20230926145015-xb9cwqv","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926145015-xb9cwqv","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926145015-xb9cwqv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926145018-y33sx9d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926145018-dv6otf3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926145018-dv6otf3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:27,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:27\u0026#125;","title":"【百合滑石代赭汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926145018"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926145018-y33sx9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926145018-y33sx9d","updated":"20230926145018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：百合七枚、滑石三两、代赭石如弹丸大（碎，棉裹）"}]},{"ID":"20230926145018-gf7qu8d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926145018-gf7qu8d","updated":"20230926145018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右三味，以水先洗，煮百合如前法，别以泉水二升，煮二味，取一升，去滓，合和，重煎，取一升五合，分温再服。"}]},{"ID":"20230926145018-dv6otf3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926145018-dv6otf3","updated":"20230926145018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【13.3】百合病，见于下之后者，百合滑石代赭汤主之。"}]}]}